                    <tr>
                        <td>
                            <span id="Label19" style="display:inline-block;color:Red;font-family:Arial;font-size:X-Small;font-weight:bold;width:504px;"></span></td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
                <table>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="height: 21px; width: 45%;">
                            <span id="Label6" style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;">Welcome</span></td>
                        <td style="height: 21px; width: 55%;">
                            <span id="Label5" style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;">Data Providers</span></td>

                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td bgcolor="gainsboro" style="vertical-align: top;">
                            <ul style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 8pt;">
                                <li>The Clinical Trials Search Portal provides access to a central database containing the trial registration data sets provided by the registries listed on the right. It also provides links to the full original records.
                                    <br>
                                </li>
                                <li>To facilitate the unique identification of trials, the Search Portal bridges (groups together) multiple records about the same trial. <a href='https://www.who.int/clinical-trials-registry-platform/the-ictrp-search-portal/linking-related-records-on-the-ictrp-search-portal' target='new'>More information</a><br>
                                    <br>
                                </li>
                                <li>Please note: This Search Portal is not a clinical trials registry. <a href='https://www.who.int/clinical-trials-registry-platform/network/trial-registration' target='blank'>How to register a trial</a><br>
                                    <br>
                                </li>
                                <li>It is possible to export the results of the search into XML.  <a href='https://www.who.int/clinical-trials-registry-platform/network/who-data-set/downloading-records-from-the-ictrp-database' target='blank'>More information</a><br>
                                    <br>
                                </li>
                                <li>The Crawling service is currently not available. If you wish to use this service in 2025 or when it is made available please <a href='https://forms.gle/cJVp7X7kvyXLqoaB7' target="_blank">fill this survey</a><br>
                                    <br>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            </ul>
                        </td>
                        <td bgcolor="gainsboro" style="vertical-align: top; width: 425px;">
                            <!-- GD 2021-07-23 removed by Ghassan's request 
                                <span style="font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial">
                                <span id="Label21" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;width:504px;">Data sets from <a href='http://www.who.int/ictrp/search/data_providers/en/index.html' target='blank'>data providers</a> are updated every Friday evening according to the following schedule:</span></span>
                            <br />
                            <span id="Label23" style="font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;">Every week:</span>
                                -->
                            <ul>
                                <span id="lblAustralia" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Australian New Zealand Clinical Trials Registry, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b><br></span>
                                <span id="lblChinese" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Chinese Clinical Trial Registry, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b><br></span>
                                <span id="lblClinical" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>ClinicalTrials.gov, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b><br></span>
                                <span id="lblCtis" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:664px;"><li>Clinical Trials Information System (CTIS), last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblEUClinical" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>EU Clinical Trials Register (EU-CTR), last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblISRCTN" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>ISRCTN, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblNetherland" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>The Netherlands National Trial Register, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                            </ul>
                            <!-- GD 2021-07-23 removed by Ghassan's request 
