                                <span id="lblBrazilian" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:564px;"><li>Brazilian Clinical Trials Registry (ReBec), last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblIndia" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Clinical Trials Registry - India, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b><br></span>
                                <span id="lblKorea" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Clinical Research Information Service - Republic of Korea, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblCuba" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Cuban Public Registry of Clinical Trials, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblGerman" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>German Clinical Trials Register, last data file imported on <b>12 October 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblIran" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Iranian Registry of Clinical Trials, last data file imported on <b>1 June 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblJapan" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Japan Registry of Clinical Trials (jRCT), last data file imported on <b>14 September 2026</b></span>
                                <span id="lblPanafrica" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;width:464px;"><li>Pan African Clinical Trial Registry, last data file imported on <b>14 September 2026</b></span>
